      "Fastify · Express · mysql2 · pg · ioredis · ws · bcrypt · jsonwebtoken など。素のJavaScriptもコンパイルできます。既知の未対応箇所はリポジトリに一覧があります。",
    wall: `追跡中の node:* モジュール ${parity.modules}個`,
    perModule: "モジュール別の成功率 →",
  },
  ko: {
    caption: `가 Node 26 호환성 목표입니다. 현재 ${total}개 중 ${passing}개의 테스트가 통과합니다.`,
    body: `Node 26의 테스트 스위트를 모듈별로 Perry에서 실행하고 출력을 Node와 비교합니다. ${parity.modules}개 모듈에 걸친 ${total}개의 테스트. 실패한 테스트는 저장소에 정리되어 있습니다.`,
    progress: `${passing} / ${total} 통과`,
    target: `목표: ${parity.target}%`,
    npmTitle: "실제 NPM 패키지를 네이티브로 컴파일",
    npmList:
      "Fastify · Express · mysql2 · pg · ioredis · ws · bcrypt · jsonwebtoken 등. 순수 JavaScript도 컴파일됩니다. 알려진 미지원 항목은 저장소에 정리되어 있습니다.",
    wall: `추적 중인 node:* 모듈 ${parity.modules}개`,
    perModule: "모듈별 통과율 →",
  },
  pt: {
    caption: `é a meta de compatibilidade com o Node 26. Hoje passam ${passing} de ${total} testes.`,
    body: `Executamos a suíte de testes do Node 26 no Perry, módulo a módulo, e comparamos a saída com a do Node. ${total} testes em ${parity.modules} módulos. Os testes que falham estão listados no repositório.`,
    progress: `${passing} / ${total} aprovados`,
    target: `meta: ${parity.target}%`,
    npmTitle: "PACOTES NPM REAIS, COMPILADOS PARA NATIVO",
    npmList:
      "Fastify · Express · mysql2 · pg · ioredis · ws · bcrypt · jsonwebtoken e mais. JavaScript puro também compila. As lacunas conhecidas estão listadas no repositório.",
    wall: `${parity.modules} MÓDULOS node:* MONITORADOS`,
    perModule: "Taxa de aprovação por módulo →",
  },
  th: {
    caption: `คือเป้าหมายความเข้ากันได้กับ Node 26 ตอนนี้ผ่านแล้ว ${passing} จาก ${total} เทสต์`,
    body: `เรารันชุดทดสอบของ Node 26 กับ Perry ทีละโมดูล แล้วเปรียบเทียบผลลัพธ์กับ Node รวม ${total} เทสต์ใน ${parity.modules} โมดูล เทสต์ที่ไม่ผ่านมีรายการอยู่ใน repository`,
    progress: `ผ่าน ${passing} / ${total}`,
    target: `เป้าหมาย: ${parity.target}%`,
    npmTitle: "แพ็กเกจ NPM จริง คอมไพล์เป็นเนทีฟ",
    npmList:
      "Fastify · Express · mysql2 · pg · ioredis · ws · bcrypt · jsonwebtoken และอื่น ๆ JavaScript ธรรมดาก็คอมไพล์ได้ ส่วนที่ยังขาดซึ่งทราบแล้วมีรายการอยู่ใน repository",
    wall: `โมดูล node:* ที่ติดตาม ${parity.modules} โมดูล`,
    perModule: "อัตราการผ่านรายโมดูล →",
  },
  tr: {
    caption: `Node 26 uyumluluğu için hedeftir. Bugün ${total} testin ${passing} tanesi geçiyor.`,
    body: `Node 26'nın test paketini modül modül Perry üzerinde çalıştırıp çıktıyı Node ile karşılaştırıyoruz. ${parity.modules} modülde ${total} test. Başarısız testler depoda listelenir.`,
    progress: `${passing} / ${total} geçti`,
    target: `hedef: ${parity.target}%`,
    npmTitle: "GERÇEK NPM PAKETLERİ, YEREL OLARAK DERLENMİŞ",
    npmList:
      "Fastify · Express · mysql2 · pg · ioredis · ws · bcrypt · jsonwebtoken ve daha fazlası. Düz JavaScript de derlenir. Bilinen eksikler depoda listelenir.",
    wall: `TAKİP EDİLEN ${parity.modules} node:* MODÜLÜ`,
    perModule: "Modül bazında başarı oranları →",
  },
  vi: {
    caption: `là mục tiêu tương thích với Node 26. Hiện có ${passing} trên ${total} bài kiểm thử đạt.`,
    body: `Chúng tôi chạy bộ kiểm thử của Node 26 trên Perry theo từng module và so sánh kết quả với Node. ${total} bài kiểm thử trên ${parity.modules} module. Các bài kiểm thử thất bại được liệt kê trong repository.`,
    progress: `${passing} / ${total} đạt`,
    target: `mục tiêu: ${parity.target}%`,
    npmTitle: "GÓI NPM THỰC TẾ, BIÊN DỊCH THÀNH MÃ GỐC",
    npmList:
      "Fastify · Express · mysql2 · pg · ioredis · ws · bcrypt · jsonwebtoken và nhiều gói khác. JavaScript thuần cũng biên dịch được. Các thiếu sót đã biết được liệt kê trong repository.",
    wall: `${parity.modules} MODULE node:* ĐƯỢC THEO DÕI`,
    perModule: "Tỷ lệ đạt theo module →",
  },
  id: {
    caption: `adalah target kompatibilitas Node 26. Saat ini ${passing} dari ${total} tes lulus.`,
    body: `Kami menjalankan test suite Node 26 terhadap Perry modul demi modul dan membandingkan output-nya dengan Node. ${total} tes di ${parity.modules} modul. Tes yang gagal tercantum di repositori.`,
    progress: `${passing} / ${total} lulus`,
    target: `target: ${parity.target}%`,
    npmTitle: "PAKET NPM NYATA, DIKOMPILASI KE NATIVE",
    npmList:
      "Fastify · Express · mysql2 · pg · ioredis · ws · bcrypt · jsonwebtoken, dan lainnya. JavaScript biasa juga bisa dikompilasi. Kekurangan yang diketahui tercantum di repositori.",
    wall: `${parity.modules} MODUL node:* YANG DIPANTAU`,
    perModule: "Tingkat kelulusan per modul →",
  },
  "zh-Hans": {
    caption: `是 Node 26 兼容性的目标。目前 ${total} 项测试中已通过 ${passing} 项。`,
    body: `我们逐个模块地在 Perry 上运行 Node 26 的测试套件，并将输出与 Node 对比。共 ${parity.modules} 个模块、${total} 项测试。失败的测试已在仓库中列出。`,
    progress: `${passing} / ${total} 通过`,
    target: `目标：${parity.target}%`,
    npmTitle: "真实的 NPM 包，原生编译",
    npmList:
      "Fastify · Express · mysql2 · pg · ioredis · ws · bcrypt · jsonwebtoken 等。纯 JavaScript 同样可以编译。已知差距已在仓库中列出。",
    wall: `${parity.modules} 个受跟踪的 node:* 模块`,
    perModule: "各模块通过率 →",
  },
};
const t = pick(copy, lang);
---

<section class="section section--paper parity">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="top">
      <div class="figure">
        <h2 class="figure__heading">
          <span class="number" data-count data-reveal>{parity.target}%</span>
          <span class="caption" data-reveal style="--i: 1">{t.caption}</span>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="explain">
        <p class="body muted" data-reveal style="--i: 2">{t.body}</p>
        <div class="progress" data-reveal style="--i: 3">
          <div class="progress__labels t-mono">
            <span class="progress__value">{t.progress}</span>
            <span class="accent">{t.target}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="track" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="track__done" data-grow="x" style={`width: ${donePct}%`}></div>
            <div class="track__target" style={`left: ${parity.target}%`}></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="npm" data-reveal style="--i: 4">
          <h3 class="npm__title mono-label">{t.npmTitle}</h3>
          <p class="npm__list">{t.npmList}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="wall">
      <span class="mono-label muted">{t.wall}</span>
      <a class="wall__link mono-label" href={links.github}>{t.perModule}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .parity .wrap {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 64px;
  }
  .top {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 80px;
  }
  .figure {
    flex: 0 0 560px;
  }
  .figure__heading {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .number {
    font-size: clamp(112px, 14vw, 200px);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    line-height: 0.9;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .caption {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.6px;
    line-height: 34px;
  }
  .explain {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .body {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 26px;
  }
  .progress {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .progress__labels {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .progress__value {
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .track {
    position: relative;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    background: var(--paper-border);
  }
  .track__done {
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 2px;
    background: var(--paper-text);
  }
  .track__target {
    position: absolute;
    top: -4px;
    width: 2px;
    height: 18px;
    background: var(--accent);
  }
  .npm {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    padding-top: 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .npm__title {
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .npm__list {
    font-size: 17px;
  }
  .mono-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  .wall {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    padding-block: 14px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--paper-text);
  }
  .wall__link {
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }
  .wall__link:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .top {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
      gap: 48px;
    }
    .figure {
      flex-basis: auto;
    }
    .caption {
      font-size: 22px;
      line-height: 28px;
    }
    .wall {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
